<!--
    v0.1.27 — Android Auto media app descriptor. Declares that this app is a
    media app so the car's Android Auto host (phone-side app) exposes it in the
    driver-safe media UI, which renders the MediaLibrarySession browse tree
    (Suno Local → Playlists → saved playlists → tracks). No templated Cars App
    Library UI and no AAOS-specific module in this pass.
-->
